"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"The tariffs will apply to $20 billion worth of American products, which could harm the stability of the world's largest trading relationship. Foreign Secretary Ed Miliband is expected to impose restrictions on products and services today, a move that Israel and the US do not support.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tariffs on American Products\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los impuestos van a afectar productos americanos que valen 20 mil millones de d\u00f3lares, lo que puede da\u00f1ar la relaci\u00f3n comercial m\u00e1s grande del mundo. Se espera que el Secretario de Relaciones Exteriores Ed Miliband ponga restricciones a productos y servicios hoy, algo que Israel y Estados Unidos no apoyan.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Impuestos a Productos Americanos\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"An investigation will be started into an incident where female employees felt humiliated, according to a union representative.\",            \"english_title\": \"Investigation on Employee Incident\",            \"translated_version\": \"Se va a empezar una investigaci\u00f3n sobre un incidente donde empleadas se sintieron humilladas, seg\u00fan un representante del sindicato.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Investigaci\u00f3n sobre Incidente de Empleadas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The bodies of Jake and Callum Robinson and their American friend were found with gunshot wounds to their heads.\",            \"english_title\": \"Bodies Found with Gunshot Wounds\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los cuerpos de Jake y Callum Robinson y su amigo americano fueron encontrados con heridas de bala en la cabeza.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Cuerpos Encontrados con Heridas de Bala\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A headteacher in the occupied West Bank has put up new barbed wire fencing after three students were killed this year.\",            \"english_title\": \"New Fencing in West Bank School\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un director en la ocupada Cisjordania ha puesto nueva cerca de alambre de p\u00faas despu\u00e9s de que tres estudiantes fueron asesinados este a\u00f1o.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Nueva Cerca en Escuela de Cisjordania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Five people died and five others were seriously hurt when a Boeing 767-300 went off the runway at Miami International Airport.\",            \"english_title\": \"Plane Accident in Miami\",            \"translated_version\": \"Cinco personas murieron y otras cinco resultaron gravemente heridas cuando un Boeing 767-300 se sali\u00f3 de la pista en el Aeropuerto Internacional de Miami.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Accidente de Avi\u00f3n en Miami\"        }    ]}"